//doi.org/10.1038/s41586-021-04108-8" publication="Nature article" /><outline text="Tian et al. (2022): This critique argues that the linguistic, genetic and archaeological analyses do not provide conclusive evidence for that family or its proposed farming dispersal. This is rejection of the evidence, not a demonstrated alternative superfamily." url="https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.06.09.495471" publication="bioRxiv preprint, version 1" /><outline text="Robbeets et al. (2022): The response revises datasets and approaches while defending the proposed relationship and the triangulation argument." url="https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.10.05.510045" publication="bioRxiv preprint, version 1" /></outline><outline text="Northeastern Tungusic" node-id="nort3417" source="glottolog"><outline text="Northern Tungusic" node-id="nort3147" source="glottolog"><outline text="Ewenic" node-id="ewen1234" source="glottolog"><outline text="Even" node-id="even1260" source="glottolog"><outline text="Conditional placements"><outline text="According to Glottolog 5.3: Ewenic" url="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.18840935" node-ref="ewen1234" /><outline text="According to WALS Online / CLDF: Tungusic" url="https://wals.info" node-ref="wals:genus-tungusic" /></outline><outline text="Middle Even" node-id="midd1358" source="glottolog"><outline text="Allaikha" node-id="alla1250" source="glottolog" /><outline text="Moma Even" node-id="moma1245" source="glottolog" /><outline text="Tompon" node-id="tomp1241" source="glottolog" /></outline><outline text="Western Even" node-id="west2887" source="glottolog"><outline text="Lamunkhin" node-id="lamu1253" source="glottolog" /><outline text="Indigirka" node-id="indi1257" source="glottolog" /><outline text="Tjugasjir" node-id="tjug1234" source="glottolog" /></outline><outline text="Eastern Even" node-id="east2811" source="glottolog"><outline text="Berjozovka" node-id="berj1234" source="glottolog" /><outline text="Upper Kolyma" node-id="uppe1414" source="glottolog" />